{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Hanging out with Friends"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Table for Six"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le01ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Questions with Sentences / Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " You can use questions that contain sentences to ask for clarification. When a question has a sentence structure in it, it is called an <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification."}, {"type": "text", "content": "An <span class=\"strong\">embedded question</span> builds on a simple question. <br/>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: What are you going to do after work today?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question</span>: Do you know what you're going to do after work today? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Embedded questions have the same word order as in statements. Look at the chart for a further explanation:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Main Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Embedded Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what you're going to do after dinner? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what the time is?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which evening would suit you best? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"which fitness club I should go to? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Don't you think \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"it sounds a bit too intense? \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you tell me which evening would suit you best?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you know how many teams there are in Cambridge?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use two different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> for predictions about actions or situation in the future. It can also be for situations you cannot control or decisions made at the moment of speaking.</li>  <li>You use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> for intentions, plans or ambitions.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Structure</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You will have a terrible hangover tomorrow because you drank too much beer. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are going to book a table for eight at the restaurant.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm going to organize a few team-building activities  next week. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll probably come next Tuesday, then."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Don't drink too much beer, though. You'll have a terrible hangover."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We're going to start a trivia night group."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll compete all around the city! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "You're going to have tough competitors."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll give them a run for their money!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "team-building"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a type of action designed to enhance social relations among colleagues"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm going to organize a few team-building activities."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a conversation about social activities."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "karaoke"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an activity involving singing to a prerecorded audio while reading the lyrics on a screen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm taking my colleagues to a karaoke bar after dinner."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le01ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tone-deaf"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unable to be in tune with the music"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is nothing like bonding over tone-deaf singing!"}, {"type": "audio",